  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mapping and Vaccination Service Delivery to Migrant Population of Djibouti</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposal &apos;Capacity Strengthening for Informed Management of Migrant Mobility in Djibouti&apos; aims to scale innovative interventions. This proposal ensures a systematic understanding of migratory dynamics through a combination of mapping, field surveys, and operational assessments. This comprehensive innovative approach enables precise data collection and subsequent targeted interventions.</narrative>
  </description>
